{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements.\n\nThe user's interest is: 摄影学习 (photography learning), focusing on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions. Explicitly NOT interested in equipment promotions (器材促销) or photographers' private lives (摄影师私生活).\n\nI need to select 20 distinct candidates from the working set of 80.\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The candidates have titles with patterns like:\n- \"静物布光\" (still life lighting), \"运动追焦\" (motion tracking), \"逆光人像\" (backlit portrait), \"雨天反光\" (rain reflection), \"夜景曝光\" (night exposure), \"室内白平衡\" (indoor white balance), \"微距景深\" (macro depth of field), \"街头构图\" (street composition), \"风光滤镜\" (landscape filter), \"儿童抓拍\" (children candid shots)\n\nAnd content types embedded in descriptions:\n- \"条件与原理\" (conditions and principles) - matches interest (imaging principles, adjustments under conditions)\n- \"操作记录\" (operation records) - matches interest (actual shooting methods)\n- \"概念速览\" (concept overview) - matches interest (learning)\n- \"专题观察\" (special topic observation) - about photography exhibitions, curator clues, author biographies, artwork history - this is more about art history/viewing experience, less aligned with shooting methods\n- \"市场观察\" (market observation) - about camera purchase packages, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements - this is EXACTLY what the user does NOT want (器材促销/equipment promotions)\n\nSo the user explicitly does not want 器材促销 (equipment promotions) or 摄影师私生活 (photographer private lives).\n\nThe \"市场观察\" content type is about camera purchase packages, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements - this is equipment promotion content. Should be excluded.\n\nThe \"专题观察\" content is about photography exhibitions, curator clues, author biographies, artwork history - this is more about art history and viewing experience, not actual shooting methods. Th